## Quickstart

```bash
cp .env.example .env
cp docker-compose.override.yml.example docker-compose.override.yml
{% if use_caddy %}docker network create caddy_net   # once per host
{% endif %}
docker compose up --build
```

{% if use_shinobi and use_strawberry %}
The REST API is live at `http://localhost:8000/api/v1/health`, and the
GraphQL API (with a GraphiQL explorer in dev) at
`http://localhost:8000/graphql/`. The same JWT works against either.
{% elif use_shinobi %}
The API is live at `http://localhost:8000/api/v1/health`.
{% elif use_strawberry %}
The GraphQL API (with a GraphiQL explorer in dev) is live at
`http://localhost:8000/graphql/`.
